---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About – CraveSmart"
  description="Learn more about CraveSmart and the mission behind the recipes."
>
  <section class="bg-white text-gray-900 py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-5xl">
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-heading font-bold mb-8 text-center">
        About CraveSmart
      </h1>

      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12">
        <div class="flex-1 space-y-6 text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            CraveSmart brings together high-protein breakfasts, dinners, snacks and desserts, with ingredient lists, cooking steps and serving information.
          </p>

          <p>
            Every recipe on CraveSmart has been tested and tweaked for big flavor and smart macros. Think high-protein meals and treats you’ll actually look forward to making.
          </p>

          <p>
            From quick breakfasts and easy dinners to snacks and desserts worth making again, everything here is curated to help you enjoy food without overcomplicating it.
          </p>

          <p>
            Nutrition figures are estimates. Ingredient brands, portion sizes and additions can change the values; check each recipe's notes before using the numbers for meal planning.
          </p>

          <p>
            <a href="/recipes/" class="underline hover:text-tiffany">Browse the recipes</a>, or
            <a href="/contact" class="underline hover:text-tiffany">send a recipe question or correction</a>.
          </p>

          <p class="font-medium text-tiffany">
            Cook smarter, crave boldly, and make indulgence work for you.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
